# Universal PR completion and workspace ownership

Applies to **all** Dealality streams: GDI, ADP, Hotel Explorer, Integration Controller.

## Not complete

Do **not** declare a task complete because a PR opened, CI passed, or GitHub shows merged.

Completion requires: CI pass → merge into `main` → owning permanent workspace on home branch → home/`HEAD` synced to `origin/main` → Cursor branch corrected → feature branch retired when safe → explicit clean or preserved-dirty report → evidence preserved → peers undisturbed.

## Ownership

Registry is authoritative: `docs/ai-build-system/worktree-registry.json`.

Before branch mutations: verify worktree root, owning stream, current branch/HEAD, target branch, unresolved merge/rebase, dirty/untracked, and preservation needs.

Fail closed on cross-workstream checkouts/merges. Cursor UI branch chips are not Git truth.

## Preservation

Never auto stash/discard/force-checkout/reset/`git clean` to make Source Control look clean.

## Fail-closed COMPLETE

Do not return COMPLETE with null/omitted/unknown merge SHA, CI, home sync, or `NOT_ASSESSED` preservation. Prefer GitHub PR evidence over caller booleans. Cursor/retirement must be verified or marked `OUTSTANDING: …`.

## Status vocabulary

- `COMPLETE — MERGED_AND_HOME_SYNCED — CLEAN_WORKTREE`
- `COMPLETE — MERGED_AND_HOME_SYNCED — PRESERVED_DIRTY`
- `BLOCKED — EVIDENCE_INCOMPLETE`
- `BLOCKED — PRESERVATION_REQUIRED`
- `BLOCKED — CROSS_WORKSTREAM_BRANCH`
- `BLOCKED — UNCLASSIFIED_BRANCH`
- `BLOCKED — UNRESOLVED_GIT_OPERATION`
- `BLOCKED — HOME_NOT_SYNCED`

Enforcement is **PARTIAL** (preflight/sync/report are machine-gated; raw git and Cursor chips can bypass). Do not claim universal enforcement.

## Commands

```bash
npm run dealality:git-preflight -- --op <op> --stream <integration|he|adp|gdi>
npm run dealality:post-merge-sync -- --mode post-merge --stream <he|adp|gdi> --pr <n>
npm run dealality:pr-completion-report -- --stream <he|adp|gdi|integration> --pr <n>
npm run dealality:pr-completion-report -- --audit
npm run dealality:pr-completion-report -- --coverage
```

